Package: evanxlsx
Type: Package
Title: Simple Consistent Excel Exports
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Evan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "104670239+lianglunping@users.noreply.github.com")
Author: Evan [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Evan <104670239+lianglunping@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Exports a data frame or a named list of data frames to an
    Excel workbook using 'openxlsx2'. Provides a single font, configurable
    alignment and font size, blank missing values, frozen headers,
    bounded column widths, and three-line borders. Existing files are
    protected by default and backed up before an explicitly requested
    overwrite. Does not upload data or install fonts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.3)
Imports: openxlsx2 (>= 1.29)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    xml2,
    tibble
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: A zip utility supported by openxlsx2
